I found several recovery problems: “Fix and verify again” returns to a form that hides the saved credential fields, and changing products leaves old verification results usable. Add-mode Cancel also retains a newly created tenant and leaves it active, contrary to C29’s acceptance requirement. The live Vulture verification is explicitly blocked in the evidence packet.
